OL,3,GNEWSAAudio bus displays a 'game
OL,4,Achanger' says blind man
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew displays for electric buses have
OL,7,Fbeen a "game changer" for visually
OL,8,Fimpaired people, a blind man has said.
OL,10,FHugh Spence, 34, from Northampton, was
OL,11,Fpart of a team of 20 people with sight
OL,12,Fissues to try out and provide feedback
OL,13,Fon, the new Stagecoach Midlands ePaper
OL,14,Fdisplays across the town.
OL,16,FHe said having something so simple,
OL,17,Fthat included buttons with braille and
OL,18,Fspoken information, just "worked" and
OL,19,Fthat he felt people had been "listened
OL,20,Fto".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
