OL,3,GNEWSAAudio bus displays a 'game
OL,4,Achanger' says blind man
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added that usually, while waiting
OL,7,Ffor the bus, he would just have to keep
OL,8,Fhis arm out for possibly up to 10
OL,9,Fminutes, and then ask the driver or
OL,10,Fanother traveller what number it was.
